{"id":"e813e4bc357a66fad5399ca60427fb8b85fdd00e529679ceb1704020439c3df4","at":"2026-10-27T06:17:55Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["398109fd72bfe0d43f82c0468244e37efcaed9d5d17ea939c13470a155875037"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Source.LdapTest: groups from memberOf","hash":"57a46707"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/07-native-ldap.md#ldap-member-of","hash":"5929cf80"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"split from the search/memberOf test: from: :member_of, required_group staff, mapping staff=>admin gives alice [admin] and bob :not_in_group, exactly the hint","basis":"review"}
{"id":"4d15ebb2a2f52518592995ed9c0882598701867f04927b8d050901c08d934826","at":"2026-10-27T06:17:57Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["3c72d3b13bf2b67b7c42b614b62de2d9bfcc0a73900a385467e26e6b07876903"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Source.LdapTest: the sections of spec 07: failures told apart, TLS verified, each failure logged by name and never a password","hash":"fe85d24b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/07-native-ldap.md#auth-ldap-connect","hash":"1a535016"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§2 prose: LDAPS and StartTLS to port 1 are :connect_failed, untrusted StartTLS :tls_failed; the log names the source with explanation and host:port, never the service or user passwords; tls_options has verify_peer, SNI host, depth 3, cacertfile or system cacerts, hostname match fun, and verify_none when verify_peer false, which diagnose reports as NOT verified","basis":"review"}
{"id":"a8069158cd7315f0fdb9afd80fc43ceb89334f480911d207a1b77aa8fdbdc755","at":"2026-10-27T06:17:59Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["72e12c4f40df108205cbcb04c718328cf9ec8caf1ac694fdb6765ec60e86d733"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Source.LdapTest: the sections of spec 07: no password, a trimmed username, the directory's spelling, the entry's attributes","hash":"bb6534a9"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/07-native-ldap.md#auth-ldap-flow","hash":"912f7dd3"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§3 prose: nil password :empty_password even with an unreachable directory (before connecting); username trimmed; empty username :user_not_found; a missing search base is no entry; ALICE signs in as alice; extra groups are the group DNs; absent id_attr gives the DN as external id; a non-ASCII password is refused, not a crash; every connection process started ends after success or failure","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b58f8fc1ee6c2d503ced5a0f0832bada53cce20322ce789dd974b9a263f071d4","at":"2026-10-27T06:18:02Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["b4d52b66ea5d0b1e77aa39afe4407fc683eb50c77fc6e6dff29be0a777072309"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Source.LdapTest: the sections of spec 07: groups by memberOf, by member DN, by memberUid as spelled; matched by DN or CN; roles once","hash":"3bf3584f"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/07-native-ldap.md#auth-ldap-groups","hash":"c67e5aa4"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§4 prose: memberOf groups with required_group named by DN in upper case and mapping by CN in another case; member searched by DN (alice in staff, bob not); memberUid by the directory spelling (ALICE gets admin); roles each once across two groups; default_role when no mapping matches","basis":"review"}
