{"id":"135a5279f7797f4a6e7e79e06cb0dfee0ef01690d0fb08d694708df929f0c298","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:17Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["df1f729ae4db902bfb51d9a35d26485adc489077bc7ba1d85e3e603f635f9268"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: a block takes a hash's time: a blocked wrong guess spends the no-user verification too, and verifies nothing","hash":"1f182f91"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#throttle-timing-work","hash":"0eb6403a"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"with the counting hasher, a blocked wrong guess (:throttled) sends {:hasher, :no_user_verify} and refute_received {:hasher, :verify}","basis":"review"}
{"id":"5dbd3197d0a4563932893b8dbbfd5a1ff097ddc010b4cc3d9543ef4ee70240ed","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:20Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["dc678654aa5bd91ca0a5080c9dd7f0ff2a4f8725e8886103177795a1c5e780f8"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: attempts inside the wait aren't failures: the next wait grows only with checked ones","hash":"5899d5e7"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/05-native-config.md#native-throttled-not-counted","hash":"2aa6fa03"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"05 §1.2 hint: after five failures, ten attempts inside the one-second wait are :throttled; a failure at 1 000 makes check give {:delay, 2 000} (not more), and the right password signs in at 3 000","basis":"review"}
{"id":"a38befe91f9190b00a0d0d38cffbeba8f9b569598564c25d9bd3eba7036d623e","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:22Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["953e1a59f094fe639498f302ff34b71a2f63282c95079aeab7b76b271fad36be"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: the window: the current step and one either side are accepted; two and three steps away are refused","hash":"539aa8a2"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#totp-window","hash":"8a2e1350"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"merged from two tests: offsets -1, 0, 1 each assert Totp.verify == :ok on a fresh enrolled user; offsets -2, 2, -3, 3 each assert {:error, :invalid_code}, the hint's two halves in one test","basis":"review"}
{"id":"8be39e648413493eefd584a3383ff6c9dc0db7cd4a0b9c583e4034e82f8ff0df","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:24Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["434e88671f56f6062e742997f84316d92d6b670fec13d7e48980ebf4a51557b4"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: the window: spaces and dashes are ignored; anything else is the same refusal","hash":"cdf40368"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#totp-normalize","hash":"11fc86d3"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"merged from two tests: \" a b \" and \"a-b\" splits of valid codes assert :ok; \"\", \"12345\", \"1234567\", \"abcdef\", nil, 123456 and 100 ones each assert {:error, :invalid_code}","basis":"review"}
{"id":"3e7356b7c6703e3348ec7416d1f8e80367967b71993d01069749326aefe25056","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:26Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["bd5746e84ba9e3e3225818ade90bda0de5e8ce815b4fb020ccd9d45dc6e640f9"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: recovery codes: regenerating replaces them all; a user not enrolled has none to regenerate","hash":"f1e217f4"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#recovery-regenerate","hash":"169df90b"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"merged from two tests: ten new codes and recovery_codes_left 10, every old code refused and hd(new) accepted, and regenerate for a never-enrolled user == {:error, :not_enrolled}","basis":"review"}
{"id":"dc011c1ab94fd9e70a5d31c1277f255ed43c93988b7bc6530863f22984aa6172","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:28Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["1b3b5789a069a871fcc5e2ca8d50e3b83e3e5553eca49d94be9c826f814102d5"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: policy: the setting is checked","hash":"6eaeebda"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#totp-policy-setting","hash":"3c3d8f22"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"split off the issuer check: Config.parse with totp_required [] and \"yes\" each match {:error, \"totp_required: \" <> _}, the fault naming the setting","basis":"review"}
{"id":"7ff61f0d2ef8010a43524e1ea2a9edd35272ac62610136fefe9ea49a7aff059d","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:30Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["a4cb4495de255294086f6cb8d51e1eda7486a45a84eeb2ae51efba845ca29b30"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: policy: the issuer is checked: it prefixes the label, so it has no colon","hash":"c3dc7afd"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#totp-issuer-setting","hash":"5e707c38"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"split from \"the setting is checked\": Config.parse with totp_issuer \"a:b\" matches {:error, \"totp_issuer: \" <> _}","basis":"review"}
{"id":"941b4bbcd66f5cf1e85c5b4b7a7ef35c617aec8990184363aed3c2cf7918e7ab","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:32Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["a32d0077e8086c479b6148fe24e04837edf32594bc78a5e6258ab666cbe80b0d"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: the sections of spec 11: the Totp functions don't throttle, Native's do; every function honors :now","hash":"8535abe9"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#auth-totp","hash":"ca5692e8"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"six wrong codes straight to Totp.verify then the right one is :ok (Totp doesn't throttle); five wrong through Native.verify_second_factor, then the right code is {:error, :throttled} from verify_second_factor/3 and disable/3 (Native's throttle); enroll_confirm and regenerate with :now record totp_enabled_at, totp_last_step and inserted_at at that time","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c134c84b7dd906fa04aa2788d59124f9cdcc8fe508ce0d89fe753a58e4d48d6c","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:32Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["2133011c1d290fe4028111cb4b408cd51c350d7adfe2418b46825581b0808310"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Totp","hash":"8c9ee0e6"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#auth-totp","hash":"ca5692e8"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"six wrong codes straight to Totp.verify then the right one is :ok (Totp doesn't throttle); five wrong through Native.verify_second_factor, then the right code is {:error, :throttled} from verify_second_factor/3 and disable/3 (Native's throttle); enroll_confirm and regenerate with :now record totp_enabled_at, totp_last_step and inserted_at at that time","basis":"review"}
{"id":"75f20dba4755facf4509dffa7dab937a4896dc0a011e75b8a748ef326d760055","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:34Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["2d9382115f817096fc245e5c58f6bb9aee17167babc23672bec72ffd1471e35a"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.TotpTest: the sections of spec 11: codes are RFC 6238's at six digits, steps are 30 seconds, input is normalized","hash":"bc4fa3ac"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/11-native-totp.md#auth-totp-codes","hash":"ef2fd5c3"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"code/2 matches RFC 6238 appendix B's SHA-1 vectors at six digits (287082 at 59 s, 081804 at 1111111109 s, unix or DateTime); step/1 is div(s, 30); enroll secret 20 bytes; normalize/1 strips spaces, tabs and dashes and upper-cases, keeps 64 bytes, gives \"\" for 65 bytes and non-binaries; ten characters outside the recovery alphabet are refused and spend nothing","basis":"review"}
