{"id":"3ff6407c0b43228a5e4a7eb17ae31e9933fc27b17f6dcd6c839762219252cc02","at":"2026-10-27T06:36:07Z","commit":"7705590ec4f2b89554527d01b131dbbb10f2280e","parents":["635ef0839a1ac49904e033a4cbca4e37caa0df262432626d396d81bc738303ff"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.authorize/2","hash":"2084d576"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-authorize","hash":"dabcf9de"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"Reviewed after #88 reworded §4.1's signed-out bullet only (authorize/2's code unchanged): assert_raise ArgumentError on {:manage, owner: 1} checks 'opts takes only :resource'; the signed-out request with unasked_resource/1 halted to /login checks the signed-out redirect and the resource asked only when signed in; the allowed admin's conn returned equal checks 'the conn, untouched'; the owing session passed unchanged checks that it neither checks nor sends a step. The refusal and remembered-GET claims are its hints' tests (plug-authorize, plug-authorize-signed-out).","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b4c1ae9039b72ce7b16463e4ac0923f19efdba3b804082c19c29b6a2695cd7ba","at":"2026-10-27T06:36:54Z","commit":"7705590ec4f2b89554527d01b131dbbb10f2280e","parents":["244a69155e19ecc33e80e79c41284e3472778f7c48709ca99511464967c80077"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.ApplicationTest: the dependencies and OTP applications are the spec's; a native configuration fault refuses boot","hash":"06eaedaf"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/00-overview.md#auth-dependencies","hash":"c2222c2e"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"Judgement: #88 only appended v0.3.1 to §3's release paragraph (the require_role signed-out change, and #65's complete_step :now fix released). The dependencies, their tags and the OTP applications the test checks are unchanged; the release history states no behavior of this section, each change being its own section's (02 §4, 09 §6).","basis":"judgement"}
